===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|transitive|chiefly physics or biomechanics}} To [[bend]] something.
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[repeatedly]] bend one of one's [[joint]]s.
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To move part of the [[body]] using one's [[muscle]]s.
# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To [[tighten]] the [[muscle]]s for display of size or strength.
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1994|author=Elise Title|title=Body Heat|page=189|passage=He rubbed his hands together. "Believe it or not, there was a time when I considered giving acting a go. What do you think, Miss Fox?" He '''flexed''' impressive biceps. "Would I have had a chance against the Schwarzeneggers and the Chuck Norris types?"}}
# {{lb|en|intransitive|slang|by extension}} To [[flaunt]] one's superiority.
#* {{quote-song|en|title=Hey Fuck You|album=w:To the 5 Boroughs|year=2004|artist=w:Beastie Boys|passage=I've got billions and billions of rhymes to '''flex''' / 'Cause I've got more rhymes than Carl Sagan's got turtlenecks}}
#* {{RQ:Noire Thug-A-Licious|page=108|passage=I shook my head, wondering if I was gonna have to knock Pimp on his ass. "I don't know where," I '''flexed''' on him with my height advantage, "you getting all this 'soft' bullshit from, dawg, but you just keep fuckin around. I can show you gangsta better than I can tell you."}}
#* {{quote-song|en|title=Kill Jill|artist=w:Big Boi|feat=Killer Mike; Jeezy|album=Boomiverse|year=2017|passage=They say it's lonely at the top, but this the best shit ever / Hey, don't you see me out here shinin'? Bitch I'm barely '''flexin''''}}

